TI  - SEA: Low-Resource Safety Alignment for Multimodal Large Language Models via Synthetic Embeddings
AU  - Lu, Weikai
AU  - Peng, Hao
AU  - Zhuang, Huiping
AU  - Chen, Cen
AU  - Zeng, Ziqian
